# Graft — configuration
#
# Graft calls an LLM for concept nodes + per-symbol summaries, so an API key is
# required for the deep pass (`build --deep`). The structural build (`build`,
# `check`, `ask`, `grep`, `map`, traversal) is deterministic tree-sitter and
# needs no key.
#
# The default endpoint speaks the Anthropic Messages wire format and uses the
# model id gpt-5.6-luna.

# --- Default: Anthropic Messages-compatible endpoint --------------------------
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=
# The base URL is optional when using api.anthropic.com, but gpt-5.6-luna is a
# custom model id and normally requires the endpoint that serves it.

# --- Graft overrides -----------------------------------------------------------
# These take precedence over provider-specific environment variables.
# GRAFT_PROVIDER=anthropic
# GRAFT_API_KEY=
# GRAFT_BASE_URL=
# GRAFT_MODEL=gpt-5.6-luna

# --- OpenAI-compatible alternative --------------------------------------------
# Set the OpenAI wire format, then provide your own key, model, and endpoint.
# GRAFT_PROVIDER=openai
# GRAFT_API_KEY=
# GRAFT_MODEL=openai/gpt-4o-mini
# Examples for GRAFT_BASE_URL:
#   OpenRouter:  https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
#   Fireworks:   https://api.fireworks.ai/inference/v1
#   Groq:        https://api.groq.com/openai/v1
#   LiteLLM:     http://localhost:4000   (your proxy)
#   Ollama:      http://localhost:11434/v1
# GRAFT_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1

# --- Deprecated (OpenAI-compatible provider only) -----------------------------
# If GRAFT_PROVIDER=openai and GRAFT_API_KEY is unset, these legacy OpenRouter
# variables are used as fallbacks.
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...
# OPENROUTER_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
# GRAFT_OPENROUTER_MODEL=openai/gpt-4o-mini

# --- Graph location -----------------------------------------------------------
# Where the graph lives (default: <repo>/.context)
# GRAFT_DIR=.context

# --- Benchmark (bench/) -------------------------------------------------------
# Per-role model overrides for the benchmark harness.
# BENCH_AGENT_MODEL=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5
# BENCH_JUDGE_MODEL=anthropic/claude-opus-4.8
